  "style": "teach_then_qa",
  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hook",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "why_lose_points_html",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "注意哈，屋面卷材起鼓，很多人只写修补防水层、重新铺卷材，就容易丢分。修补不是盖一层新卷材，而是先治病因，再恢复防水闭合，最后检验。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 12.816,
      "requestId": "c065ac25-d951-97bb-84e4-d91770ff0942",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "disease",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "steps[0].scoring_expression",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "先认病。卷材下面的气和水汽顶起来，形成鼓泡。答题先把起鼓这个病害对象说清楚，后面措施才有靶子。",
      "startSec": 13.216,
      "durSec": 9.432,
      "requestId": "0d074a13-8b5d-9060-8a5e-f99f718abf09",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "cut",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "steps[1].scoring_expression",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第一步治病因，沿鼓泡割个十字口，先放气。不放气就直接盖新卷材，过几天还会再鼓。",
      "startSec": 23.048,
      "durSec": 8.04,
      "requestId": "da59d7de-393a-9496-b2e3-2f6f47ca6221",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "dry",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "steps[2].scoring_expression",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "接着排尽气和水汽，让基层和卷材下表面充分干燥。再清掉旧胶结料和杂物，这一步最多人漏。",
      "startSec": 31.488,
      "durSec": 9.192,
      "requestId": "99720f5c-5ff6-9ff9-8468-344154e7b527",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "add",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "steps[5].scoring_expression",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "恢复防水第一招，是增铺附加层。附加层要盖过原起鼓或切割边缘，把薄弱区整个包住，不是贴一小块补丁。",
      "startSec": 41.08,
      "durSec": 9.6,
      "requestId": "72b8901e-b1e5-9cc3-8c66-9e840725f4f9",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "seal",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "steps[6].scoring_expression",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "再铺新卷材。喷灯烘烤，分层剥开旧卷材，铺贴压实，和原防水层搭接牢固，边缘和搭接缝都要封严。",
      "startSec": 51.08,
      "durSec": 10.248,
      "requestId": "196619d1-32e0-94c0-9919-b94c76c904bc",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "test",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "steps[7].scoring_expression",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后闭环，做蓄水或淋水检验，确认不渗漏才验收。案例题常常就考你这最后一句。",
      "startSec": 61.728,
      "durSec": 7.584,
      "requestId": "21d2869d-e5d7-9371-b1c3-70ca798bdc33",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "scoring_points[0].keywords",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "答题纸上盯住这些采分词：放气、擦干、清除旧胶结料、喷灯烘烤、分层剥开、重贴新卷材。写到了就稳。",
      "startSec": 69.712,
      "durSec": 11.088,
      "requestId": "0676e2a3-eeea-9145-964b-2fb7829f8685",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，我写割开排气、晾干后重新铺卷材，这样能拿分不？",
      "startSec": 81.2,
      "durSec": 7.536,
      "requestId": "e4a6b3f4-0ff3-95e1-ab76-d8c9d935974b",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[2].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "方向对，但还漏了三处闭合：基层处理、附加层盖过边缘、搭接封严。阅卷看的是防水闭环有没有恢复。",
      "startSec": 89.136,
      "durSec": 9.6,
      "requestId": "2b976327-9714-9893-8d1a-1d760ff90526",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那我直接在鼓泡上加铺一层新卷材，不也挺省事儿吗？",
      "startSec": 99.136,
      "durSec": 4.56,
      "requestId": "5c42091a-cfa0-9f11-a0ae-55a919af3d81",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[1].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不行，顺序错了。底下气和水汽没排，基层没干，盖上去过阵子照样鼓。必须先放气干燥，再铺。",
      "startSec": 104.096,
      "durSec": 9.192,
      "requestId": "db7d39c8-9991-9958-a323-d9ffdd599691",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "铺完新卷材以后，是不是就算修好了？",
      "startSec": 113.688,
      "durSec": 4.08,
      "requestId": "6e660551-f484-9f84-ac8e-f7314086d647",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[3].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "还差最后一步检验。蓄水或淋水确认不渗漏，才算闭环。漏了它，案例题最后那分就容易丢。",
      "startSec": 118.168,
      "durSec": 8.232,
      "requestId": "7f46de90-44b1-93df-8689-cb4fe7dc4bc1",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing_challenge",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "memory_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后收束一句哈：先放气干燥，再附加封严，最后试水闭环。现在进闯关，换个答法看你能不能写成采分句。",
      "startSec": 126.8,
      "durSec": 10.296,
      "requestId": "da3b2138-dc4a-92f7-8968-ee4f383b6560",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
}